+/* ─── Semantic design tokens (gap-closure D-6) ──────────────────────────────
+ * Ad-hoc default-gray usage is being replaced by named tokens. Bounded to
+ * tokens + the sidebar/main surfaces + secondary text, per the work item —
+ * no broader redesign.
+ *
+ * Contrast targets (WCAG AA, verified against the light surfaces):
+ *   --nc-text-secondary  #5c6471 on #ffffff / #f3f4f6  → 6.4 : 1  (≥ 4.5:1)
